  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1615/946/logo-png.png\" width=\"700\" alt=\"烈焰剑 Logo\"><br><br>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">使火焰附加附魔显示火焰效果</h2>\n  <h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3kbz7edSa6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\"></a></strong></h1> <h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3135\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1439126/description_677c18a6-c84d-4903-b389-c22b63f5a363.png\" alt=\"想要服务器？使用 Sparked Host\" width=\"292\" height=\"64\"></a></h1>\n  <br>\n  <p>这款资源包改变了当剑附上火焰附加时的纹理。</p><p>对于1.21.4及以下版本，需要安装CIT模组，而1.21.5已新增自定义物品纹理功能。</p><p>铜剑和下界合金剑拥有不同的颜色。</p><p>3D 锤子和弓来自 tixul 的附魔轮廓。</p><p>烈焰剑现已支持 tixul 的 [附魔轮廓](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fglowing-glints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/glowing-glints</a>)</p><p>您可以使用 [ResPackOpts](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts</a>) 切换资源包的部分功能。</p><p>如果没有动画效果，请尝试在视频设置中关闭“仅显示可见纹理动画”。</p>\n  <br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"铜剑轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"铜矛\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1615/936/diamond-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"钻石剑\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"钻石矛轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"火焰弓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"金剑轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"金矛\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"铁矛轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"附魔锤\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"锤子火焰轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"下界合金剑轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"下界合金矛\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"石矛轮廓\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"木剑轮廓\"><br>\n</div>",
